# Bilingual format

Pair each English paragraph with its Chinese translation. Write the Chinese as plain Markdown. Do not wrap any Chinese span in `<mark>` or another highlight tag.

```markdown
English paragraph.

对应的中文段落。
```

- Separate major sections with `---`.
- Keep the source structure and Markdown syntax.
- Chinese punctuation in Chinese; English punctuation in English. Quotes: 「」 or "".
- Space between Chinese and English or digits: `AI 系统`, `7 个章节`.

Quality bar: faithful meaning, natural Chinese, consistent terms, valid Markdown, images at the original positions.

## Endnotes (chapter 7)

Keep URLs, citation numbers, and technical references unchanged. Translate the descriptive text only, as plain text with no `<mark>` tags.
